&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;It should be noted that the usage of site a variable in makefile is different from using it in shell.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>CMake Make</title><link>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/compile-link/cmake-make/</link><pubDate>Fri, 16 Jun 2023 23:23:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/posts/compile-link/cmake-make/</guid><category domain="https://gaohongy.github.io/blog/categories/compile-link/">Compile-Link</category><description>&lt;h2 class="heading-element" id="说明"&gt;&lt;span&gt;说明&lt;/span&gt;
